<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Sui S. Gas half-yr net rises.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Sui S. Gas half-yr net rises.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees):</p>
<p>    Sales		7,001 vs 6,135</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     442 vs   511</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit    348 vs   342</p>
<p>    Interim dividend   nil vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Sui Southern Gas Co Ltd. There is no book closure as no interim dividend was announced. Sui Southern paid 15 percent bonus stocks for the year ended June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
